SUMMARY:Interplay 2027 — deadline
DESCRIPTION:A 15–45 minute live online performance at the intersection of
  performance and technology.\n\nArtist fee per selected artist or group.\n
 Application fee not stated\n\nEligibility: International\, all disciplines
  and career stages. Priority for projects led by women\, femmes and gender
 -diverse artists.\n\nDeadline: 2026-10-08. 23:59 Pacific\n\nSelected artis
 ts provide a technical breakdown\, a five-minute highlight edit and develo
 pment-process documentation. Live performance must be central to the work.
 \n\nOfficial call: https://interplay-arts.com/open_call.html\nChecked 2026
 -10-06
URL:https://interplay-arts.com/open_call.html
LOCATION:Online
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
