SUMMARY:Michigan Central Art × Newlab — Creative Residency 2027 — dead
 line (check time)
DESCRIPTION:A 12-week research residency in Detroit at the intersection of 
 art\, technology\, health and society\, in an Art & Tech track (Knight Fou
 ndation) or an Art & Health track (Henry Ford Health).\n\nPlus Newlab fabr
 ication shops\, project-aligned research\, mentors and a public conversati
 on series.\nApplications are free\n\nEligibility: Single applicants over 2
 5\, able to receive taxable US income via SSN\, ITIN or EIN. No groups.\n\
 nDeadline: 2026-10-30. Published as 11:59 p.m. EST\, though Detroit is on 
 EDT that day — submit early. This calendar entry is all-day\; verify the
  cutoff with the organizer.\n\nFellows are announced in January 2027 and a
 re expected in Detroit for their 12-week session.\n\nOfficial call: https:
 //michigancentral.com/michigan-central-art-x-newlab-detroit-opens-applicat
 ions-for-its-2027-creative-residency-program-supported-by-the-john-s-and-j
 ames-l-knight-foundation/\nChecked 2026-10-19
URL:https://michigancentral.com/michigan-central-art-x-newlab-detroit-opens
