 opean dimension — normally 60% of funds to people in Horizon Europe-elig
 ible countries\; others only for exceptional quality or unique expertise.\
 n\nDeadline: 2026-11-03. 12:00 noon CET\; NLnet now calls every two months
 \, on the third of odd months\n\nMilestone-based payments for completed wo
 rk.\n\nOfficial call: https://nlnet.nl/restack/\nChecked 2026-10-19
URL:https://nlnet.nl/restack/
