 ke a new solo work\, with a City catalog and a likely premiere. A new Grap
 hic Design category covers books\, typefaces and text–image work.\n\nSub
 ject to the City budget\; non-selected applicants may be named DCA Cultura
 l Trailblazers with a stipend.\nApplication fee not stated\n\nEligibility:
  Los Angeles County residents who live in the City or have presented there
  for 3+ years\, with a 15-year exhibition\, publication or performance rec
 ord. Collaborative or audience-interactive projects are ineligible.\n\nDea
 dline: 2026-11-13. 11:59 pm online\; a hard copy must be postmarked by Nov
 ember 18\n\nGrantees contribute catalog materials and use the funds for a 
 new solo work. Results June–July 2027.\n\nOfficial call: https://culture
 .lacity.gov/grants/independent-master-artist-projects-grant-program\nCheck
 ed 2026-10-19
